{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30752","headline":"献令狐相公时相公郊坛行事回 · 项斯","name":"献令狐相公时相公郊坛行事回","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鹗在卿云冰在壶，代天才业本訏谟。\n荣同伊陟传朱户，秀比王商入画图。\n昨夜星辰回劒履，前年风月满江湖。\n不知机务时多暇，还许诗家属和无。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"项斯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30752.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30752","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}